 s+='All 16 invalid R1 relay outputs omit the mode name. **Step format/range: 0; missing agent: 0; other R1 causes: 0.** In R1’s own examples, the single invalid output also omits its mode name. All seven W&W step-by-step failures are explicit released “no decisive errors found” abstentions, not malformed agent/step fields. They still score wrong for attribution, but are reported as abstentions. Example raw lines: `Error Mode: R.2` (Qwen, E2-C); `Error Mode: C.2` (Gemini, E2-C); `No decisive errors found by step-by-step analysis in file 1.json` (W&W step). Raw file paths, gold/no-gold flags and excerpts are in `baseline_diagnostics.json`.\n\n'
 rows=[]
